  "text": "设 $x,y$ 为实数，在约束 $2x^2+3y^2=1$ 下，求 $x-y$ 的最大值与最小值。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "拉格朗日乘数法",
    "柯西-施瓦茨不等式",
    "条件极值"
  ],
  "question_type": "条件极值问题",
  "method": [
    "拉格朗日乘数法求极值点",
    "柯西-施瓦茨不等式验证"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "设拉格朗日函数并求偏导方程",
    "解出 $x,y$ 关于 $\\lambda$ 的表达式",
    "代入约束求 $\\lambda$",
    "求出 $x-y$ 的极值并用柯西不等式验证"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "constrained_extremum_quadratic",
    "template": "\\max/\\min\\ x-y \\text{ s.t. } 2x^2+3y^2=1",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "最大值与最小值",
      "steps": [
        "拉格朗日条件：$\\nabla(x-y)=\\lambda\\nabla(2x^2+3y^2)$，即 $1=4\\lambda x,\\ -1=6\\lambda y$，得 $x=\\dfrac{1}{4\\lambda},y=-\\dfrac{1}{6\\lambda}$",
        "代入约束：$2\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{16\\lambda^2}+3\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{36\\lambda^2}=\\dfrac{1}{8\\lambda^2}+\\dfrac{1}{12\\lambda^2}=\\dfrac{5}{24\\lambda^2}=1$，得 $\\lambda^2=\\dfrac{5}{24}$",
        "$x-y=\\dfrac{1}{4\\lambda}+\\dfrac{1}{6\\lambda}=\\dfrac{5}{12\\lambda}$，代入 $\\lambda=\\pm\\sqrt{5/24}$ 得 $x-y=\\pm\\dfrac{\\sqrt{30}}{6}$",
        "验证用柯西-施瓦茨：$x-y=\\sqrt2x\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt3y\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt3}\\right)$，故 $(x-y)^2\\le(2x^2+3y^2)\\left(\\dfrac12+\\dfrac13\\right)=\\dfrac56$，即 $|x-y|\\le\\sqrt{5/6}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{30}}{6}$，等号可达",
        "结论：最大值 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{30}}{6}$，最小值 $-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{30}}{6}$"
      ]
    }
  ],
