      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$1=8\\lambda x,-1=2\\lambda y\\Rightarrow x=1/(8\\lambda),y=-1/(2\\lambda)$",
            "代入约束：$4/(64\\lambda^2)+1/(4\\lambda^2)=1/(16\\lambda^2)+1/(4\\lambda^2)=5/(16\\lambda^2)=1\\Rightarrow \\lambda^2=5/16$",
            "$x-y=1/(8\\lambda)+1/(2\\lambda)=5/(8\\lambda)$，代入 $\\lambda=\\pm\\sqrt{5}/4$ 得 $x-y=\\pm\\sqrt5/2 \\cdot(4/8)=\\pm\\sqrt5/2$",
            "验证：柯西不等式 $(x-y)^2\\le(4x^2+y^2)(1/4+1)=5/4$，故最大值 $\\sqrt5/2$，最小值 $-\\sqrt5/2$，一致"
