            "$2x+y=1/\\lambda+1/(6\\lambda)=7/(6\\lambda)$，代入 $\\lambda=\\pm\\sqrt{7/12}$ 得 $2x+y=\\pm\\dfrac{7}{6}\\sqrt{12/7}=\\pm\\dfrac{7}{6}\\cdot\\dfrac{2\\sqrt3}{\\sqrt7}=\\pm\\dfrac{7\\sqrt3}{3\\sqrt7}=\\pm\\dfrac{\\sqrt{21}}{3}$",
            "验证：柯西不等式 $(2x+y)^2\\le(2x^2+3y^2)(2+1/3)=7/3$，即 $|2x+y|\\le\\sqrt{7/3}=\\sqrt{21}/3$，一致，最大值 $\\sqrt{21}/3$，最小值 $-\\sqrt{21}/3$"
